# Tests

- Unit tests for pure logic; integration tests against real Postgres/Redis/NATS via Compose.
- Erasure coding: property test that any 10 of 16 fragments reconstruct the chunk; random shard drops.
- Tickets: property test expiry, wrong-node, wrong-fragment, and tampered signature all fail.
- Do not assert on log text. Assert on returned errors and stored state.
- `-short` skips Compose-backed tests so hooks and CI stay fast.
- Chaos scenarios belong in the harness (`chaos-scenario` skill), not in unit tests.

```go
func TestReedSolomonRoundTrip(t *testing.T) {
    t.Parallel()
    // encode → drop any 6 shards → decode equals original
}
```
